+**Current result:** 37 programs have been released (`endDate` set) and are
+`CALCULATED`; 48 remain `UNRESOLVED` because they are still running. Totals:
+818 shifts = 409 days, BDT 163,600 salary + BDT 5,200 conveyance = **BDT
+168,800**.
